Manage component extension index metadata

Usage:
  eshu component index [command]

Available Commands:
  verify      Verify a component extension index for local or CI publication gates

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for index

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization

Use "eshu component index [command] --help" for more information about a command.
